---
description: Aegis architecture boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---
- UI never talks directly to privileged infrastructure.
- Domain logic must not live in React components.
- Provider-specific behavior belongs behind provider adapters/capability contracts.
- AI is accessed through the AI Gateway, never directly from UI components.
- Database access is server-side and policy-aware.
- Domain state changes occur through commands/use-cases, not arbitrary writes.
- Prefer explicit ports/interfaces at infrastructure boundaries.
